== A8 mado:66-72 ==
  66| - Composition, stated before the run: **4 defects were cut at sites whose assertions this lane
  67|   could name in the suite's own scenarios** ("in-surface": D1, D2, D4, D6) and **6 at seams it
  68|   predicted unasserted** ("out-of-surface": D3, D5, D7, D8, D9, R1). Measured: **4/4 killed
  69|   and 0/6 killed**. The split is by construction, so the honest reading is neither "weak" nor
  70|   "strong": here the suite's assertion set and its kill set are **co-extensive** — nothing
  71|   outside the asserted surface was caught, and nothing inside it escaped. The 40 % rate is
  72|   composition, not a regression of the suite (band-amendment precedent, §4).
